Source: sensor-bme680
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ed Baker <ed@ebaker.me.uk>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), libwildlifesystems-dev (>= 1.3.0)
Standards-Version: 4.6.1
Homepage: https://github.com/Wildlife-Systems/sensor-bme680

Package: sensor-bme680
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, sensor-control (>= 1.3.0)
Suggests: bash-completion
Description: Read BME680 environmental sensors
 Reads temperature, humidity, pressure and gas resistance from Bosch BME680
 sensors over I2C on a Raspberry Pi, and outputs readings in the JSON format
 of the WildlifeSystems sensor framework, for use through sr(1).
